        "helpful": 19
      },
      {
        "id": "wuthering-waves-3",
        "recommended": false,
        "postedAt": "2025-03-22",
        "text": "Good game, but the gacha rates and daily tasks start to feel like a chore. Hard to keep up if you only have an hour a day.",
